=== layout: bookend

# Learning Objectives

@body

- Identify [*p and q arms*]{color=#B74300}
- Recognize chromosome groups A-G
- Decode a [*chromosome address*]{color=#24578F}
- Compare [*band*]{color=#003FFF} positions on the same [*arm*]{color=#B74300}
- Read [*karyotype notation*]{color=#24578F}

=== layout: definitions

# Chromosome Address Terms

@body

- *Centromere*: constriction between the arms
- [*p Arm*]{color=#B74300}: short; p = petite
- [*q Arm*]{color=#B74300}: long; q = not p
- [*Cytogenetic Address*]{color=#24578F}: [*chromosome*]{color=#D40000}, [*arm*]{color=#B74300}, [*band*]{color=#003FFF} location

